    "en": {
      "trackName": "Drop Merge Watch Game",
      "description": "Drop Merge Watch Game is a quick and satisfying number puzzle built for your wrist.\n\nTap a column to drop the next tile.\nWhen matching numbers touch, they merge into a higher value.\nPlan every move carefully, because space runs out fast.\n\nFeatures:\n\nOne-tap, quick-session gameplay\nSmooth drop and merge chain reactions\nScore and best score tracking\nPause, resume, restart, and sound toggle\nClean interface optimized for small screens\nEasy to start, challenging to master.\nHow high can you merge?",
